        (size 2.54 2.54))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ba81f82e-2f53-4e4d-a3a6-26a9391bdb2c"))
  (text "Reuse on Port A, B or C. S0..S5 are local channel numbers, not hardwired Pico GPIOs."
    (at 19.05 27.94 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "2397d54c-8b44-4db8-a90d-f595edaa8656"))
  (text "Only one servo may be powered from the present bench supply. Channels 1..5: DNP."
